One player is playing a tower defense game with a standard top down view of the map while other players are playing a MOBA but in first person view, limiting their information
TD player controls minion spawning and tower placement, including manipulating the path of minions by building barriers and towers. Initial map is fairly sparse with barriers and jungle areas, built up over time by the opposing TD players. MOBA players collect resources for the TD player to utilize for building as well as fighting enemy minions and opposing MOBA players
